    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Debug Interaction Flow",
    "long_instructions": "\r\n# Debug Interaction Flow\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Make sure clicking a button shows the correct details for the correct card.\r\n\r\n1. **Test a Button Click:** Click one card and watch what happens. Does only that card change?\r\n2. **Check the Console:** Add a console.log inside your click handler to confirm which card was clicked.\r\n3. **Confirm the Right Card Updates:** Make sure your code updates only the selected card, not all of them.\r\n4. **Check Your Data:** If the wrong details appear, confirm you are using the correct id or index.\r\n5. **Prevent Repeating Content:** If details show up multiple times, clear the detail area before adding new content.\r\n\r\n**Optional:** If nothing shows up, double check that your reveal logic runs after the button is clicked.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Trace what happens when a user clicks a card. Fix issues with targeting, async timing, or details showing up in the wrong place. ***(supports completing Milestone 2 tasks)***",
